# ReadPI <-> Zotero bridge — English strings.
# Fluent files must live under locale/<locale>/ inside the add-on; Zotero
# registers them automatically.  Message IDs are prefixed with the plugin name
# because the FTL namespace is shared with Zotero and other add-ons.

# Item-list right-click entry, Zotero 8 MenuManager entry and reader page
# context-menu label.
babeldoc-menu-open =
    .label = Read in ReadPI

# PDF reader toolbar button: value = button text, .title = tooltip.
babeldoc-toolbar-open = ReadPI
    .title = Read in ReadPI
